        <td width="2%" bgcolor="#24559E">&nbsp;</td>
        <td valign="top" width="74%"><font size="2">Welcome to
        the Research &amp; Special Programs Administration's (RSPA) Public Affairs web page. </font><a
        href="http://www.rspa.dot.gov/"><font size="2">RSPA</font></a><font
        size="2"> is responsible for a variety of safety and
        regulatory programs. The Office of Pipeline Safety is
        responsible for regulating the safe transportation of 1.5
        million miles of interstate &amp; intrastate natural gas
        pipelines. The Office of Hazardous Material
        Transportation issues standards for almost all types of
        hazardous materials transportation. Also, the </font><a
        href="http://www.volpe.dot.gov/"><font size="2">Volpe
        National Transportation Systems Center</font></a><font
        size="2"> is an organization within RSPA dedicated to
        enhancing the effectiveness, efficiency, and
        responsiveness of other Federal organizations with
        critical transportation-related functions and missions. </font><hr>
